Bug 4 — Text content cannot be edited via double-click

Description:
Text elements can no longer be edited using a double-click interaction.

Observed Behavior:

When double-clicking on a TextBox, text editing does not start.

The text cursor does not appear.

The text content cannot be changed directly on the canvas.

Expected Behavior:

Double-clicking a TextBox should enter text-edit mode.

The user should be able to modify the text content directly.

Additional Note:

There is currently no alternative way to edit the text content via the Properties panel when a text element is selected.